'''Jerome Kyle "J. K." Schaffer''' (born June 10, 1990) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[linebacker]] in the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Cincinnati Bearcats football|Cincinnati Bearcats]]. He signed as an [[undrafted free agent]] with the Jaguars in 2012 and has also played for the [[Cincinnati Bengals]].
